57d09950-3bc6-43e3-9408-be7c913008ee	dc8c110c-4a07-469f-9fb8-8b90328eecff	3	TEXT	214.HD-ACT-HC Hướng dẫn vv Đăng ký xe đi công tác.pdf	BM0T\nCÔNG TY CÔỎ PHẦN VIỄN THÔNG ACT                         CỘNG HÒA XÃ HỘI CHỦ NGHĨA VIỆT NAM\nĐƠN VỊ/ PHÒNG BAN                                                      Độc lập - Tự do — Hạnh phúc\nSá: ......./PPK-ACT-HC                                        J7pHCM,ngày tháng năm 2024\nPHIẾU ĐĂNG KÝ XE\nKính gửi: Phòng Hành chính\n- Căn cứ VàO................0777006nni nen nen nen nh)\n- Căn cứ Vào ................--nnnnnneneennnnn nen                   mm.\n_ Đêbáo đảm .................................. Nay ................. kính đê xuât Phòng Hành chính đảm bảo xe công tác như sau:       :_\n|          Đơn vị | Nội dung công       Số         Người lên            -         - | Loại           —                 ñ         Ñ\n STT   đề xuất           việc         | người         hệ SĐT         Nơi đi       ơi đên      xe         Ngày đi        Ngày về      Ghi chú\nmaụ      ] Nghiệm thu dị       | Nguyễn Văn A | VPBình | Kiê      mi         mm       .\nLI |KDA | PP ĐỜI 5          gen văn           Bình | Xiến U - lá | ././2024 |../../2024\nán             |                    _ 098xxxxxxx          giã           giang\nPHÒNG HC                                          TRƯỞNG ĐƠN VỊ                              NGƯỜI LẬP\n(Ký, ghi rõ họ tên)                                    (Ký, ghi rõ họ tên)                           (Ký, ghi rõ họ tên)	4	Đây là mẫu phiếu đăng ký xe công tác, dành cho nhân viên công ty Cổ phần Viễn thông ACT gửi lên Phòng Hành chính để xin cấp xe công tác cho chuyến đi cụ thể.	{"Phiếu đăng ký xe","Phòng Hành chính","Công ty Cổ phần Viễn thông ACT","đơn vị","ngày đi/Ngày về","đối tượng nhân viên","mã quyết định 214.HD-ACT-HC"}	{"Làm thế nào để lên đơn đăng ký xe đi công tác?","Cần cung cấp những thông tin nào trong phiếu đăng ký xe?","Ai là người ký duyệt phiếu đăng ký xe?","Thời gian yêu cầu xe trước ngày đi là bao lâu?","Có cần đính kèm giấy tờ nào khác khi nộp phiếu không?"}	{ALL}	{ALL}	[-0.02859233,-0.037750784,-0.04332856,0.009794454,0.005123112,0.01828668,-0.013695405,0.018592946,-0.013801287,-0.0021828285,-0.0047121006,0.016329568,0.017903749,-0.0014761792,0.050957512,-0.05981716,0.0609314,-0.038033005,0.04447567,-0.010787136,-0.01919484,-0.010945908,-0.032773226,-0.027039845,0.005685812,0.017673025,-0.0018047544,-0.04703873,-0.004915901,0.026145494,0.017696466,-0.015802907,0.015791118,0.012635229,0.017081099,-0.04207297,0.0015069703,0.04096723,0.020499974,-0.035957977,0.0059315073,0.0653995,0.008823715,-0.048608415,-0.022236774,0.03920899,-0.058302063,0.0076086954,-0.020442823,0.041765835,-0.02022315,0.009479533,-0.010336927,0.011086409,0.025126196,0.011540681,-0.0015283527,0.035862204,0.006699443,0.0812962,0.033154175,-0.07675561,-0.019218754,0.022175243,-0.013106624,-0.043973193,-0.04274882,0.024985416,0.007936785,-0.019341836,-0.015810108,-0.0012704859,-0.070351884,-0.008722791,0.008723688,0.002849867,-0.014514701,0.107268,-0.002939013,0.030950667,-0.032747462,-0.014340684,0.03910687,-0.057251602,-0.00033762355,0.028645203,-0.03792254,-0.00760527,-0.053375095,-0.003145348,-0.009894725,0.011334727,0.007778943,0.033332404,-0.03914874,0.039825212,0.014317574,0.018386643,-0.065245315,0.009917807,-0.01766227,0.0027131927,0.021318763,0.0112455115,-0.05478203,-0.036265638,-0.057038765,0.03554565,-0.029042456,0.016428445,0.0452588,0.029626288,-0.016199788,-0.050157994,-0.030115979,-0.071806684,0.07288583,-0.01925031,0.018039849,0.00842455,0.021660097,-0.0025858849,-0.014891668,0.029532757,-0.058945384,0.003342907,0.063792706,-0.065987594,-0.012194236,0.10640042,-0.0056110863,-0.027170314,-0.0215193,-0.015046148,0.02500682,0.02650119,-0.028760139,-0.016694417,-0.059730515,-0.06350898,0.03064362,0.063935935,-0.016208703,0.0005646058,-0.02915193,0.010929745,0.0039557796,0.010860419,0.016005866,0.08358507,-0.043908875,-0.022195904,-0.016923483,-0.01832318,-0.01580865,-0.03047921,-