84b9e9c6-924c-4691-8d4c-30a7cc387886	6d21b860-c0bc-4447-a086-8fc187bf8002	218	TEXT	QuyCheQuanTri-Petrolimex-PMSC.pdf > CHƯƠNG 6 – CÁC HOẠT ĐỘNG KHÁC > Điều 97. Kỷ luật	1. HĐQT có trách nhiệm xây dựng hình thức kỷ luật dựa trên tính chất và mức độ của việc vi phạm. \nViệc kỷ luật phải có hình thức cao nhất là bãi nhiệm, cách chức.\n\n2. Thành viên HĐQT, Kiểm soát viên, người điều hành doanh nghiệp không hoàn thành nhiệm vụ \ncủa mình so với yêu cầu với sự trung thực, siêng năng, cẩn trọng sẽ phải chịu trách nhiệm cá nhân \nvề những thiệt hại do mình gây ra.	50	Quy định về Kỷ luật: 1. HĐQT có trách nhiệm xây dựng hình thức kỷ luật dựa trên tính chất và mức độ của việc vi phạm.	{HOẠT,ĐỘNG,KHÁC,luật,HĐQT,trách,nhiệm,xây}	{"Kỷ luật là gì?","Quy định về Kỷ luật như thế nào?","Nội dung chi tiết của Kỷ luật gồm những gì?","Nội dung theo Điều 97. Kỷ luật được áp dụng ra sao?"}	{ALL}	{ALL}	[-0.06892596,-0.02750587,-0.007975209,-0.03370514,0.02348944,0.014105672,0.018046489,-0.031258944,0.032965057,0.010659793,0.011893991,-0.059003472,0.009787437,-0.083511,0.00016252827,-0.015255766,-0.0010750439,3.4735524e-05,0.039264616,-0.018251562,-0.014657477,-0.005256184,0.015584991,-0.02839051,0.038736872,0.024186613,0.0749264,-0.051428534,0.0017459762,-0.024623176,-0.026975224,0.062232498,-0.00759596,-0.009928183,-0.033463676,-0.082092464,0.0011331016,-0.030594435,0.014475895,-0.0027301044,-0.027000112,0.05035228,-0.0257007,0.02837704,0.01724796,0.02509473,-0.026785102,-0.02181708,0.023343258,-0.028421767,-0.05869994,0.029312724,-0.05697146,0.0642229,-0.035464905,-0.019181618,-0.0109295035,0.06630049,0.0012781032,0.00068297144,0.038637124,-0.054881264,-0.018663112,0.03279896,-0.029614365,-0.045415413,-0.012159279,0.002360533,-0.009354774,-0.006143416,-0.019702476,0.07912379,-0.036897805,-0.06661405,0.032949846,0.06182343,-0.009856893,-0.022336986,0.009707861,-0.023099238,0.029952034,0.06973673,-0.006406497,0.010472298,-0.089443274,-0.044669006,-0.049086276,0.015446446,0.01581274,-0.029