6ff315d4-a2bf-4953-8cb5-8a346c490e2f	ebe23234-01a2-4d3a-8df0-db79738f2070	18	TEXT	bo-luat-lao-dong-2019.docx > Chương II > Điều 11. Tuyển dụng lao động	1. Người sử dụng lao động có quyền trực tiếp hoặc thông qua tổ chức dịch vụ việc làm, doanh nghiệp hoạt động cho thuê lại lao động để tuyển dụng lao động theo nhu cầu của người sử dụng lao động.\n\n2. Người lao động không phải trả chi phí cho việc tuyển dụng lao động.	\N	Quy định về Tuyển dụng lao động: 1. Người sử dụng lao động có quyền trực tiếp hoặc thông qua tổ chức dịch vụ việc làm, doanh nghiệp hoạt động cho thuê lại lao động để tuyển 	{Tuyển,dụng,lao,động,quyền,trực,tiếp,thông}	{"Tuyển dụng lao động là gì?","Quy định về Tuyển dụng lao động như thế nào?","Nội dung chi tiết của Tuyển dụng lao động gồm những gì?","Nội dung theo Điều 11. Tuyển dụng lao động được áp dụng ra sao?"}	{ALL}	{ALL}	[0.04290408,-0.031547107,0.0018277061,0.0075867977,0.015060468,0.032167017,0.012950173,-0.0093264915,0.015169001,-0.0011272661,0.03523921,-0.029946668,0.01426338,-0.04623764,-0.0109239295,0.013054409,-0.02944472,0.00022118253,-0.07003483,0.057928532,-0.02606787,0.0042369026,-0.016393086,-0.06487911,-0.08210684,0.021707138,0.04136645,0.004777059,-0.030504454,0.02627887,0.027007446,0.010853756,0.03836348,0.030695638,-0.063265584,0.018684197,-0.03192546,0.03751773,-0.001509873,0.048264634,0.027430454,-0.050727025,0.042946246,-0.031380236,-0.0034052206,-0.041510012,-0.055239663,-0.010182114,0.0077959797,-0.041481566,-0.023831807,0.04812208,-0.03018107,-0.007072704,0.0407529,0.007615709,0.006224877,-0.015304574,-0.0055176634,-0.03306538,-0.013979537,-0.044250835,-3.8471437e-05,-0.044518203,0.026715813,-0.084758155,0.004824124,0.011032527,-0.0018406465,-0.06287062,0.0032205388,-0.06007441,-0.033473697,-0.04374027,0.012220512,-0.032794617,0.0047100955,0.039071035,-0.0069614192,-0.06142127,0.0022726285,-0.029484883,0.0036462182,-0.024532497,0.0025879475,0.023753768,0.0017323489,-0.029112482,-0.060092136,-0.03352136,-0.002565383,-0.074