11127ffd-ea3e-45e8-a57b-8cbfc9f71694	ebe23234-01a2-4d3a-8df0-db79738f2070	147	TEXT	bo-luat-lao-dong-2019.docx > Chương IX > Điều 133. Chương trình an toàn, vệ sinh lao động	1. Chính phủ quyết định Chương trình quốc gia về an toàn, vệ sinh lao động.\n\n2. Ủy ban nhân dân cấp tỉnh trình Hội đồng nhân dân cùng cấp quyết định Chương trình an toàn, vệ sinh lao động của địa phương và đưa vào kế hoạch phát triển kinh tế - xã hội.	\N	Quy định về Chương trình an toàn, vệ sinh lao động: 1. Chính phủ quyết định Chương trình quốc gia về an toàn, vệ sinh lao động.	{133,trình,toàn,sinh,lao,động,Chính,phủ}	{"Chương trình an toàn, vệ sinh lao động là gì?","Quy định về Chương trình an toàn, vệ sinh lao động như thế nào?","Nội dung chi tiết của Chương trình an toàn, vệ sinh lao động gồm những gì?","Nội dung theo Điều 133. Chương trình an toàn, vệ sinh lao động được áp dụng ra sao?"}	{ALL}	{ALL}	[0.012104248,-0.07223414,0.014296794,-0.049250934,0.018476924,-0.01658008,-0.016732536,-0.024220074,0.011995628,-0.057614144,0.026431121,0.008282166,0.008137815,-0.084668845,-0.04008156,-0.032322526,-0.018901095,0.03735936,0.014993693,0.04395192,-0.016447378,0.026659619,-0.07425402,-0.008221222,-0.022615023,0.04781428,0.015467016,0.0077945776,-0.055026464,0.044997945,0.012412916,-0.015918816,0.010053931,0.027137911,-0.01217013,-0.005191362,-0.044705946,0.045333147,0.02518972,-0.026623752,0.005129603,0.03837265,-0.00032939008,0.009444347,-0.023467641,-0.035134833,0.0007125195,-0.0007738655,0.00966171,0.025375018,0.035855472,-0.0063559054,-0.060007077,0.0028676316,0.0038140859,0.007816048,0.003080675,-3.8730354e-06,0.04815534,-0.0024856764,-0.0013240814,-0.07969543,-0.045357045,-0.049221165,0.02655092,-0.05348035,0.0013218902,0.027890453,-0.038895894,-0.10760946,-0.02709584,0.04926951,-0.016170314,-0.032894373,0.034605656,0.044422876,-0.029585613,0.05074285,-0.00024957137,0.012450162,0.010919779,0.008527249,0.023539595,0.035583895,0.0009672632,-0.001254062,0.046572056,-0.013088843,-0.02903728,-0