2acf3303-dcc4-4b04-b09e-c61cbf002a25	ebe23234-01a2-4d3a-8df0-db79738f2070	236	TEXT	bo-luat-lao-dong-2019.docx > Chương XVI > Điều 214. Nội dung thanh tra lao động	1. Thanh tra việc chấp hành quy định của pháp luật về lao động.\n\n2. Điều tra tai nạn lao động và vi phạm an toàn, vệ sinh lao động.\n\n3. Tham gia hướng dẫn áp dụng hệ thống tiêu chuẩn, quy chuẩn kỹ thuật về điều kiện lao động, an toàn, vệ sinh lao động.\n\n4. Giải quyết khiếu nại, tố cáo về lao động theo quy định của pháp luật.\n\n5. Xử lý theo thẩm quyền và kiến nghị cơ quan có thẩm quyền xử lý vi phạm pháp luật về lao động.	\N	Quy định về Nội dung thanh tra lao động: 1. Thanh tra việc chấp hành quy định của pháp luật về lao động.	{XVI,214,Nội,dung,thanh,tra,lao,động}	{"Nội dung thanh tra lao động là gì?","Quy định về Nội dung thanh tra lao động như thế nào?","Nội dung chi tiết của Nội dung thanh tra lao động gồm những gì?","Nội dung theo Điều 214. Nội dung thanh tra lao động được áp dụng ra sao?"}	{ALL}	{ALL}	[-0.019992823,-0.03174353,0.012401571,-0.042206813,0.03154865,-0.037965436,-0.053004775,-0.025420325,0.007234242,-0.0028636078,0.021065572,-0.020231362,0.028183931,-0.05733002,-0.015578242,0.0032107618,0.02138239,0.04833541,-0.007104541,0.056832366,0.012385919,0.010083042,-0.041586656,0.003035578,0.0026071698,0.031332687,0.01884031,-0.020885441,-0.028421255,0.035115954,-0.0044395057,-0.011106873,0.028477218,0.011887168,0.016545901,-0.034890503,0.019580783,0.04339658,-0.015048599,0.04889591,0.02287309,0.029346142,-0.024680275,0.061705157,-0.0339034,-0.027493162,-0.041081436,-0.024002213,0.003892866,0.015995853,0.00780897,0.011405927,0.0049866205,0.016882975,0.025586609,-0.019569172,0.0004058618,0.039316528,0.019753296,-0.014070764,0.030688597,-0.061906107,0.029372865,-0.03844086,0.09582037,-0.082696535,-0.045233514,0.029397512,-0.022190275,-0.0765312,0.001010715,-0.06720459,0.0009223892,-0.01992013,-0.01781656,0.0045035807,-0.081290044,0.057206914,0.031191586,-0.03174554,-0.0023473534,-0.042831417